<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Petroleum (Income Tax) (Amendment) Act 2011."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/14/eng@> .
