<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/14/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act is deemed to have come into operation on 30 November 2010. New Chapter 6 of Part III"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/14/eng@> .
